    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n*** Under Offer **\nSherry FitzGerald Stack are delighted to present \"Mount Eagle\", a spacious and well proportioned 4-bedroom, 2-bathroom detached residence set on a generous 0.37 Ha / 0.91 acre site with mature tree line boundaries.\n\nIn a sought-after location, the architecturally designed property enjoys a peaceful rural setting just 2.5km from the heritage town of Listowel and all local amenities.\n\nWith well-proportioned accommodation throughout, the residence comprises Entrance Porch & Hallway, Lounge / Sitting Room, Kitchen / Dining Room, Utility Room, 4 Double Bedrooms, Guest W/C and Family Bathroom.\n\nThe property benefits from mains water supply, onsite septic tank and fibre broadband available for connection.\n\nExternally, the detached garage extends to 24sqm approx features vehicular and pedestrian access doors, window and electricity connection, making it ideal for storage, workshop or DIY use.\n\nRequiring some modernisation, this characterful property offers an ideal opportunity for families seeking spacious living in a convenient countryside location.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Lobby - 1.53m x 1.30m\nwith glazed door and vinyl tile flooring\n\nLounge / Sitting Room - 4.80m x 4.38m\nopen fireplace with marble surround, wall paneling & bespoke shelving, carpet flooring & window\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 6.81m x 4.35m\nfitted kitchen, vinyl tile flooring, wall tiles & 2 windows\n\nUtility Room - 3.46m x 1.80m\nwith fitted units, plumbed for appliances, linoleum flooring, wall tiles & half glazed door to rear\n\nEntrance to Kitchen - 1.85m x 1.19m\nwith carpet flooring & roof light\n\nEntrance Hallway - 5.52m x 1.47m\nwith carpet flooring, fitted unit and roof light\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.49m x 3.02m\ndouble with sliding patio door & windows & carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.62m x 2.44m\ndouble with fitted units, carpet flooring & window\n\nBedroom - 4.38m x 3.62m\ndouble with fitted units, carpet flooring & window\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.85m x 2.70m\ndouble with fitted units, carpet flooring & window\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.69m x 2.41m\nwith Triton T90 XR electric shower, bath, ceramic wall tiles, linoleum flooring, whb, w/c & 2 windows\n\nGuest W/C - 2.69m x 1.34m\nw/c, whb, linoleum flooring, fitted unit (shelved) & window\n\nDetached Garage - 24sqm\nwith double and pedestrian door, electricity connected & window\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>4 bedroom, 2 bathroom detached house set on a 0.37 Ha / 0.91 acre site.</li><li>Sought after location just 2.5km from the heritage town of Listowel and all local amenities</li><li>Mature and private site </li><li>Tarmacadam driveway </li><li>Seperate pedestrian and driveway entrance </li><li>Mains water supply & onsite septic tank</li><li>Fibre broadband available for connection</li><li>Enclosed courtyard off Utility </li><li>May qualify for SEAI Grants & Vacant Homes Grant - subject to qualifying criteria</li><li>24sqm detached garage approx - ideal for storage / DIY</ul>"
      },
